{
  "_readme": [
    "Published circuit facts. Facts only — a length, a count, a race",
    "distance — each carrying the source it was read from and the date it",
    "was checked.",
    "",
    "Curate from the official circuit page for the event",
    "(formula1.com/en/racing/<year>/<slug>/circuit), which is authoritative",
    "for length, race laps and race distance. It does not publish corner",
    "counts, and its URL slug cannot be derived from a country (three races",
    "share the United States), which is why this is a human curation step",
    "rather than a runtime source.",
    "",
    "Secondary reports are not sources. A widely repeated figure can simply",
    "be wrong: Madrid circulated as 5474 m and is officially 5416 m, and",
    "Singapore circulates as 4928 and 4940 m against an official 4927 m.",
    "Where references disagree and no official figure exists, leave the",
    "field out — reference.audit() then reports it unchecked instead of",
    "agreed, and the telemetry measurement is free to cast a vote.",
    "",
    "Never add an entry from memory. An unchecked circuit must be absent:",
    "reference.facts() returning None says 'nobody has looked', which is a",
    "different and more useful statement than a plausible wrong number.",
    "Wikidata (CC0) fills the fields no curated entry covers."
  ],
  "_schema": {
    "length_m": "published lap length in metres",
    "corners": "numbered corners on the current layout",
    "direction": "clockwise | anticlockwise",
    "layout_since": "year this layout came into use, if known",
    "notes": "anything a consumer would otherwise get wrong",
    "source": "where the figures were read",
    "checked": "ISO date the entry was last verified",
    "race_laps": "scheduled race laps",
    "race_distance_km": "scheduled race distance",
    "aliases": "other names this circuit is known by upstream",
    "f1_slug": "the official site's URL slug for the event",
    "first_grand_prix": "year of the first championship race here",
    "circuit_type": "Permanent, Temporary - Street or Temporary - Road",
    "held_in": "where the race is actually run, which is not always the country the event is named for",
    "circuit_official_name": "the circuit's full official name"
  },
