    "las_vegas / vegas": "the historical results feed carries two Las Vegas circuits whose article links are crossed: the entry named for the Strip circuit points at the Grand Prix article, and the entry named for the street circuit points at the Strip circuit article. Neither is recorded here until it is clear which identifier means which layout — a specification filed against the wrong layout is worse than an absent one",
